in R.\n$$\n\nTherefore, setting ${x}_{2}=1,$ we get the eigenvector \n\n$$\n{v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFinally, $P=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139535231 true] [17592186338938 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338939 13194139535231 true] [17592186338938 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338940 13194139535231 true] [17592186338938 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338941 13194139535231 true] [17592186338938 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338942 13194139535231 true] [17592186338938 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338943 13194139535231 true] [17592186338938 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535231 true] [17592186338938 1041 "selection" 13194139535231 true] [17592186338938 1104 #edb/ref 17592186338940 13194139535231 true] [17592186338938 1110 #uuid "2dc8dfc0-386e-5fe6-a862-155dc9f936d5" 13194139535231 true] [17592186338939 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535231 true] [17592186338939 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535231 true] [17592186338939 1111 #uuid "a3c0f626-5892-5a52-80b4-8ced8f520502" 13194139535231 true] [17592186338940 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535231 true] [17592186338940 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535231 true] [17592186338940 1111 #uuid "6a6dfb09-d3a7-5cf3-ad9d-b5db55f5153a" 13194139535231 true] [17592186338941 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535231 true] [17592186338941 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535231 true] [17592186338941 1111 #uuid "e4f866f8-11c5-5336-a804-a58dc14462a0" 13194139535231 true] [17592186338942 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535231 true] [17592186338942 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535231 true] [17592186338942 1111 #uuid "cb3d90b3-2aab-56a9-b56a-8990039213b8" 13194139535231 true] [17592186338943 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535231 true] [17592186338943 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535231 true] [17592186338943 1111 #uuid "419fedc6-e1b5-5400-a395-35e2a75b196e" 13194139